wn in figure has field,</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/effd6c56f8c4348e7f5b3ff8384aca95bc6881e2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n The amount of flux passing through the air-gap if the axial length of pole is 20 cm will be _____ Wb.</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/119b53adeeed1a5b7ef236dfb8e1e6f198c42f33.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"0.146","high":"0.149"},"solution":"<p>\n 0.1475 (0.1460 - 0.1490)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/b9781fca3b4d11da91aaf58e80d789d43668c98b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/7834b692c7556b8a06989253811e3392460a2ba0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":15,"type":"MCQ","correct":"D","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>\n A wire of length <em>L</em> meter carrying current <img src=\"/media/29b11d6300e35809c27abe649ac91d73e3677e7a.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> ampere is bent in the form of a square. The magnetic moment is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/6656bd4023ef607dd9858b7961f51c2b4b92c5dc.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/63d097fbe6339b45682f8af84f45a9d7dd6acc34.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/ac205f18bb546a75a91ba0c79b1d3aa976310ddd.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/83d5648f54e11fb7d7fc4d8cf75f0539104ebf34.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (d)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/8860d7d5d8e78d083f6062e6c35bd547dd99c069.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":16,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n A nonmagnetic wire of circular cross-section has radius 10 mm and a length 100 m. It carries a total current of <img src=\"/media/156cf88e9b29dfaa190fb07b79cdff92c050bdf8.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" />A and has potential difference between ends is 10 V. Let <em>H</em> =  <img src=\"/media/305b2c2e0f33881f53f60778aeeb84025d109aac.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> where K is an unknown constant. The value of K = _______ × 10<sup>8</sup> A/m<sup>3</sup>.</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"1.55","high":"1.65"},"solution":"<p>\n 1.59 (1.55 - 1.65)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/c8730a142677e5cfbb1b3f8d865b51cc5af146f4.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":17,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n A hemispherical shell carries a current density represented by <img src=\"/media/14e074f473fd7ca85dc64c2af08f10fe95d4dbd6.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>\n The amount of current passing through hemispherical shell of radius 50 cm, <img src=\"/media/bedaf05bb7256c846af6530062bab55d5a0a3be0.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> will be ________ A. (Upto 1 decimal place)</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"24.5","high":"25.8"},"solution":"<p>\n 25.1 (24.5 - 25.8)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/6b8a957aab316f8741f81ab76816e58c3b144d96.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"}],"questionCount":17,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:12.070Z"}